WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,360
This kid is okay

2
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,360
Why does my appetite suddenly feel so good?

3
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,360
Prepare eight dishes and one soup

4
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:13,540
eight dishes

5
