Yoyo is awesome

13
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Although Grandma Liu is holding me

14
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,000
but it's me

15
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,580
Picked from the branches, it’s so sweet

16
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,580
